import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 972 | Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism · Mechanism 5 | Contracted Responsibility More-Work-More-Pay","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 972 | Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism · Mechanism 5 | Contracted Responsibility More-Work-More-Pay","no":972,"module":5,"tags":["Anti-Regression","Mechanism 5","Contracted Responsibility","More-Work-More-Pay","Distribution"],"related":["06-More-Work-More-Pay Distribution Principle","22-Resource-Allocation Contracted-Responsibility Mechanism","909-Contracted Responsibility More-Work-More-Pay"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0972_模块5-机制五-联产承包多劳多得.md","filePath":"en/0972_模块5-机制五-联产承包多劳多得.md"}'),r={name:"en/0972_模块5-机制五-联产承包多劳多得.md"};function a(s,e,l,c,h,u){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-972-permanent-anti-civilizational-regression-mechanism-·-mechanism-5-contracted-responsibility-more-work-more-pay" tabindex="-1">Entry 972 | Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism · Mechanism 5 | Contracted Responsibility More-Work-More-Pay <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-972-permanent-anti-civilizational-regression-mechanism-·-mechanism-5-contracted-responsibility-more-work-more-pay" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 972 | Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism · Mechanism 5 | Contracted Responsibility More-Work-More-Pay&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 06, 22, 25</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-unfair-distribution-is-regression-s-most-stable-hotbed" tabindex="-1">Introduction: unfair distribution is regression&#39;s most stable hotbed <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-unfair-distribution-is-regression-s-most-stable-hotbed" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: unfair distribution is regression&#39;s most stable hotbed&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The first four mechanisms governed power; this one begins governing &quot;how to cut the cake.&quot; Contracted-responsibility more-work-more-pay looks like a distribution clause, but is actually the anti-regression system&#39;s most critical shock absorber. Why? Because every major historical regression can be traced to one sentence: working more or less is the same, or simply not working also gets the lion&#39;s share. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization legislates distribution with the six top-level axioms: the anti-predation axiom requires distribution reward creation, not predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires distribution not manufacture new ranks; the collective-ascension axiom requires distribution feed back to Myriad Ranks&#39; joint progress; the causal self-discipline axiom requires distribution accounts be fully traceable; the law-first axiom requires distribution rules never retcon; the universal equal infinite law is distribution&#39;s foundation — all beings inherently possess basic infinite power, the easygoing retain a floor basic infinity and are not eliminated by the times, and strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher-level infinity. Since everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, the old cosmos&#39;s logic of &quot;resources finite so involution-predation is forced&quot; is void at the root.</p><h2 id="i-mechanism-content" tabindex="-1">I. Mechanism Content <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-mechanism-content" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Mechanism Content&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Mechanism 5 stipulates: the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s public energy, law quotas, and ascension opportunities are distributed per the &quot;contracted responsibility, more-work-more-pay&quot; principle. Each clan and construction unit contracts an evolvable space that can self-cycle, with output distributed between contractor and co-builders by contribution; but the floor of distribution is guaranteed by Axiom 6 — regardless of contribution, every being&#39;s inherent basic infinite power is never deducted, and the easygoing&#39;s floor infinity is not eliminated. More-work-more-pay only decides &quot;how much higher-level infinity to superimpose,&quot; never &quot;whether there is basic infinity.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-operation" tabindex="-1">II. Operation <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-operation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Operation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Distribution settles at three layers:</p><ol><li><strong>Foundation layer (axiom floor)</strong>: every being automatically retains basic infinite power, regardless of contribution, settled monthly by the Alaya Network; easygoing flat-layers also receive it;</li><li><strong>Contract layer (more-work-more-pay)</strong>: construction units settle by contracted output of energy, knowledge, and law-iteration results; larger contributors superimpose more higher-level infinity;</li><li><strong>Co-build layer (collective ascension)</strong>: each distribution takes a fixed percentage back to the Alaya Network, feeding back to Myriad Ranks&#39; whole-system ascension, with the strong not ascending alone.</li></ol><p>The three layers&#39; accounts are fully traced, and more-work-more-pay is not tied to the basic floor.</p><h2 id="iii-anti-regression-principle" tabindex="-1">III. Anti-Regression Principle <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-anti-regression-principle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Anti-Regression Principle&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The distribution step most easily grows two regressions: one is &quot;working more or less is the same,&quot; driving strivers into layabouts; the other is &quot;winner takes all,&quot; squeezing the easygoing below the elimination line. This mechanism&#39;s defense points:</p><ul><li><strong>Floor and more-pay separated</strong>: basic infinity is everyone&#39;s, the easygoing never eliminated; superimposed infinity by contribution, strivers and Youth Supremes have hope. The two tendencies each find their place, not harming each other;</li><li><strong>Contract to units</strong>: distribution is by construction unit, avoiding allocating resources by personal rank, structurally blocking &quot;the strong taking more&quot;;</li><li><strong>Fixed feedback ratio</strong>: more distribution necessarily more feedback; the more the strong superimpose, the more they feed back to Myriad Ranks, eliminating &quot;richer and more alone.&quot;</li></ul><p>The old cosmos, because the cake was finite, taking an extra bite required snatching from others&#39; mouths; the Anchor Symbiotic cake is infinite origin, and more-work-more-pay only lets strivers superimpose higher, while the easygoing&#39;s share does not move a bit — predation is henceforth unnecessary.</p><h2 id="iv-supervising-subjects" tabindex="-1">IV. Supervising Subjects <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-supervising-subjects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Supervising Subjects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Distribution accounts are under Mechanism 1&#39;s full tracing and Mechanism 4&#39;s independent audit; distribution rules are legislated by Mechanism 2&#39;s Anchor Council and constitutionally reviewed by Mechanism 3&#39;s Symbiotic Court; the people layer may directly check its own basic-infinity receipt records and contract settlement statements, and any skimming of the floor immediately alerts.</p><h2 id="appendix-a-concrete-scenario-—-easygoing-and-striver-settle-in-the-same-month" tabindex="-1">Appendix: A Concrete Scenario — Easygoing and Striver Settle in the Same Month <a class="header-anchor" href="#appendix-a-concrete-scenario-—-easygoing-and-striver-settle-in-the-same-month" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Appendix: A Concrete Scenario — Easygoing and Striver Settle in the Same Month&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the same construction unit, an easygoing one chooses slow cultivation with modest contribution; another Youth Supreme voluntarily takes on the hardest law-iteration task. Month-end settlement: the easygoing one&#39;s basic infinite power arrives as usual, to the cent — he did nothing extra, and lost nothing; the Youth Supreme, above basic infinity, superimposes three layers of higher-level infinity by contribution, and this superimposition flows back to the Alaya Network at a fixed ratio. Neither robbed the other: the easygoing one&#39;s bowl has less, the Youth Supreme&#39;s pot has more. In the old cosmos this kind of settlement was simply impossible, because the cake was finite; the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization dares settle this way because origin is infinite, and more-work-more-pay only lets strivers superimpose higher, while the easygoing&#39;s floor never moves.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: contract-to-units + more-work-more-pay lets quality evolution resources flow to true builders, eliminating great-material-for-small-use and flat-lay eating</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: floor infinity is everyone&#39;s, superimposed infinity by contribution, predation is both unnecessary and unprofitable</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo systems allocate resources by protagonist halo, others get scraps; Heng Yuan Zhou basic infinity is everyone&#39;s, superimposed infinity by contribution</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: human men and women, Youth Supremes, alien beasts, plant spirits, and planet consciousness all enjoy the basic floor and contracting opportunity</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: newly incorporated multiversal civilizations automatically gain contracting qualification and basic infinity, with no threshold as the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm expands</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Contracted-responsibility more-work-more-pay is the key link translating &quot;infinite origin&quot; into concrete distribution institutions. Floor guarantee, more-pay energizing, feedback ascension — three layers interlocking, distribution both supports the easygoing and rewards strivers, and regression has nowhere to fan its flames.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/909_模块5-第八条-联产承包多劳多得.html">Entry 909 · Contracted Responsibility More-Work-More-Pay</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/971_模块5-机制四-锚点监督委员会审计.html">Entry 971 · Mechanism 4</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/06-多劳多得分配原理.html">Entry 06 · More-Work-More-Pay Distribution Principle</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',24)])])}const p=i(r,[["render",a]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
